{'symbol': 'PEAK', 'date': '2022-07-19 18:54:00', 'title': 'HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES PUBLISHES ITS 11TH ANNUAL ESG REPORT', 'text': "DENVER , JULY 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HEALTHPEAK PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: PEAK) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PUBLISHED ITS 11TH ANNUAL ESG REPORT. \xa0THIS 2021 ESG REPORT MARKS HEALTHPEAK'S 11TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR PUBLISHING AN ESG REPORT AND COVERS ITS LEADERSHIP IN ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) INITIATIVES AND 2021 PERFORMANCE."}